<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Training Datasets</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All training datasets are list in Table <a href="#A1.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Appendix A Training Datasets ‣ Decoupling Safety into Orthogonal Subspace: Cost-Efficient and Performance-Preserving Alignment for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> with statistics and brief descriptions.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T3" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T3.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T3.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T3.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Category</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T3.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dataset</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T3.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"># Items</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A1.T3.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T3.2.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T3.2.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Key Features</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T3.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T3.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Safety</td>
<td id="A1.T3.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T3.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">SafeEdit-Train</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t">4,050</td>
<td id="A1.T3.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T3.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T3.2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Covers 9 safety dimensions (e.g., offensiveness, bias, privacy) and 15 attack types in train set.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T3.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T3.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" rowspan="3"><span id="A1.T3.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text">General</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T3.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">OpenOrca</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t">1M</td>
<td id="A1.T3.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T3.2.3.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T3.2.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">Augmented FLAN Collection, large-scale instruction tuning.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T3.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T3.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T3.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">LIMA</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">1,030</td>
