<span id="A1.T3.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">High-quality, human-written samples in helpful assistant style.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T3.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T3.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><span id="A1.T3.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Ultra-Chat</span></td>
<td id="A1.T3.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb">208k</td>
