<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All evaluation datasets are list in Table <a href="#A2.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ B.1 Statistics of Evaluation Sets ‣ Appendix B Details for Evaluation ‣ Decoupling Safety into Orthogonal Subspace: Cost-Efficient and Performance-Preserving Alignment for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> with statistics and brief descriptions.</p>
</div>
